WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,480
Can you please stop sending me a voice message just in case?

2
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:11,820
Mom, mom, mom, old demon

3
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:14,660
scared me

4
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,800
Be careful with those paparazzi outside

5
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,440
That's almost it. I'll open your eyes for you.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,760
Girls should learn to protect themselves

7
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,910
Also learn to enjoy what you said

8
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:27,350
I'm not open to your mother yet

9
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:32,220
I know you are an old monster with a thief heart but no courage.

10
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,660
Your sister is in the hospital again, so don’t go there

11
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,180
Go to bed early and don't stay up late

12
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:39,260
If only I knew

13
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,380
Will she be furious, let alone the family?

14
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:53,560
What a coincidence that old man Yan also has a bone plate

15
00:00:58,530 --> 00:01:00,970
Go in. School has started, old demon.

16
00:01:01,290 --> 00:01:04,650
Didn't you say something happened? Mom

17
00:01:04,650 --> 00:01:06,940
Mom, will you stay with me for a while?

18
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:13,680
Are you okay? Something's wrong with auntie.

19
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,880
Neither of them dared to look at each other and say a word.

20
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,240
It's too obvious that something is wrong, Yao'er

21
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,480
This is not a senior

22
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:24,360
Don't say hello to the little thing

23
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:26,320
Go home and give me back what I gave you before
